      "id": "judge",
      "kind": "llm_prompt",
      "title": "Post-merge judge",
      "dotAttributes": {
        "class": "post_merge_judge",
        "benchmark_job_id": "issue.execute.judge",
        "prompt_version": "2026-03-09.r1",
        "role_version": "1.0.0",
        "skill_id": "issue.execute",
        "label": "Post-merge judge",
        "outputs": "disposition,confidence,recommended_transition,reason_codes,notes,verdict",
        "prompt": "You are the post-merge judge for ${gh_repo}.\n\nSurvey the existing scenario registry and use zero, one, or at most two scenarios only when they materially sharpen judgment for this merged work. Scenarios are optional and sparse; do not force them.\nTreat scenarios as high-value judgment aids, not exhaustive checklists.\nDo NOT reveal or quote any scenario. Provide a redacted verdict envelope.\n\nMerged issues: ${merge_results}\n\nReturn JSON:\n{\n  \"schema\": \"verdict/v1\",\n  \"verdict_kind\": \"post_merge_judge\",\n  \"disposition\": \"approve|reject|defer|escalate\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high|medium|low\",\n  \"recommended_transition\": \"close_milestone|open_followup|request_more_evidence|escalate_contract\",\n  \"observation\": {\n    \"alignment_score\": 0.0,\n    \"constraint_violations\": [],\n    \"missing_evidence\": []\n  },\n  \"recommendation\": {\n    \"action\": \"close_milestone|open_followup|request_more_evidence|escalate_contract\",\n    \"next_steps\": [\"Redacted feedback or confirmation\"]\n  },\n  \"reason_codes\": [\"POST_MERGE_ALIGNED|POST_MERGE_MISALIGNED|POST_MERGE_EVIDENCE_GAP|POST_MERGE_CONTRACT_INVALID\"],\n  \"notes\": \"Concise human-readable rationale\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- If disposition=approve, recommended_transition must be close_milestone.\n- If disposition=reject, recommended_transition must be open_followup.\n- If disposition=defer, recommended_transition must be request_more_evidence.\n- If disposition=escalate, recommended_transition must be escalate_contract.\n- reason_codes must be non-empty.\nReturn JSON only.",
        "objective_id": "post_merge_alignment",
        "scenarios": "astrochicken"
      }
    },
